OL,3,AEx-rugby player says sex assault 'never
OL,4,Ahappened'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeighley-based Priim, who previously
OL,7,Frepresented Bradford Bulls, Leeds
OL,8,FRhinos and England, including at the
OL,9,F2017 World Cup, denies one count of
OL,10,Fsexual assault. The trial continues.
